  "safe_error_text": "The VPC-resolver DNS-control pod was created from the exact digest-pinned evaluation image and reached its first Pending observation while the image was pulling. The live poll then called nonexistent LiveOperations._sleep instead of the injected LiveOperations._sleeper. Its finally block attempted a synchronous pod deletion; that delete was acknowledged but exceeded the 90-second command bound, and the finalizer exception replaced the original AttributeError in the stage receipt. The DNS consistency proof therefore did not complete, the pilot Job was never created, Torch was not imported and zero evaluation rows ran. Status-keyed cleanup and an independent read-only sweep confirmed all temporary state at zero.",
